Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6core6t64 | libqt6core6, libqt6gui6, libqt6qml6, libqt6qmlmodels6, libqt6quick6, libqt6quickcontrols2-6, libqt6qmlworkerscript6, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
Description: Local-first disk space and .deb application manager
 Matrix Manager is a local-first Linux desktop utility for managing
 disk space and installed .deb applications. It never scans on its own,
 never deletes without explicit confirmation, works entirely offline and
 ships with a Vietnamese and English interface.
